        "symbol": "◆◆"
      },
      "traits": [],
      "entries": [
        "The asanbosam makes a claw Strike with its reach increased to 15 feet. On a hit, the Strike deals an additional 1d6 slashing damage and the asanbosam immediately Grabs the target and pulls it to a space adjacent to the asanbosam. This counts as two attacks for the asanbosam's multiple attack penalty."
      ],
      "requirements": "The asanbosam is positioned above a creature",
      "damage": [
        {
          "formula": "1d6",
          "average": null,
          "type": "slashing"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Drink Blood",
      "category": "action",
      "placement": "bot",
      "activity": {
        "unit": "action",
        "number": 1,
        "symbol": "◆"
      },
      "traits": [],
      "entries": [
        "The asanbosam sinks its teeth into the creature to drink its blood. If the victim is grabbed, this is automatic; otherwise, the asanbosam must succeed at an Athletics check against the victim's Fortitude DC. The victim becomes drained 1 and the asanbosam regains 10 HP, gaining any excess Hit Points beyond its maximum as temporary Hit Points. These temporary Hit Points remain for 1 minute. Drinking Blood from a creature that's already drained increases the victim's drained value by 1 to a maximum of drained 3, but doesn't restore any HP to the asanbosam. A victim's drained condition decreases by 1 each week. A blood transfusion, which requires a successful DC 20 Medicine check and a blood donor or sufficient blood, reduces the drained value by 1 after 10 minutes."
      ],
      "requirements": "A grabbed, paralyzed, restrained, unconscious, or willing creature is within reach of the asanbosam's jaws"
    }
  ],
